  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You blast into the air with a burst of flame.</p><p>Creatures adjacent to you take <strong>1 Damage</strong>. You then land at a point within <strong>5-spaces</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can use this spell to soften your landing. If you cast it as you walk off a ledge, you reduce the distance you fall by <strong>5 spaces</strong> for the purpose of determining fall damage.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may extend the distance of your jump by <strong>+1 space</strong> per extra success.</p>",
